HB0111 Hit and run-responsibility and penalties.
Sponsored By: Representative(s) Smith, S and Senator(s) Steinmetz
AN ACT relating to motor vehicles; increasing penalties for failing to stop
where an accident involves serious bodily injury or death; adding a knowledge
requirement for specified failing to stop offenses; providing clarifying
amendments; providing definitions; specifying applicability; and providing for
an effective date.
